OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 18, arrested after two
OL,4,Astabbed in city centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been arrested after two
OL,7,Fpeople were stabbed in Nottingham city
OL,8,Fcentre.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police was called to
OL,11,Freports of an altercation in Huntingdon
OL,12,FStreet shortly before 05:00 BST on
OL,13,FThursday.
OL,15,FThe force said two men, both 19, were
OL,16,Ffound in nearby Nile Street. Both were
OL,17,Ftaken to hospital with injuries that
OL,18,Fare not life-threatening or
OL,19,Flife-altering.
